/P 127 0 R
/E (But the retreat from the giga-project era preceded the war, as it was already being trimmed on fiscal grounds, well before the first attacks. The war has accentuated this shift and changed the direction of capital flows.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
